==Battleground==
*1 [[Li'l Gau (form 2) (Enemy)|Li'l Gau (form 2)]] spawns after 1.67 seconds<sup>50f</sup>.
*1 [[Judgment (Enemy)|Judgment]] spawns as the boss after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*3 [[Princess Head]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 1.67~5 seconds<sup>50f~150f</sup>.

==Strategy==
While Judgment has a decent attack range and slow ability, he has low DPS, so chip him down with units like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]]. Trying to tank it out won't work well due to the Li'l Gaus and Princess Heads in this level.

